<title>USA: Ellenville CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet Sec.</title>
<headline>Ellenville CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities, Inc. said it won $12.901 million of Ellenville CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.6983 percent.</p>
